  "sota_statement": "LambdaMART (lightgbm objective='lambdarank') is the established industrial SOTA for learning-to-rank (Burges 2006/2007; standard in web search ranking). XGBRanker (objective='rank:ndcg') is a strong alternative. Pointwise logistic regression is the classic ML baseline. RankNet (pairwise) and ListNet (listwise) are re-implemented in pure numpy as the offline Tier-1 fallback so the system runs with zero downloads. All rankers share the unified 'higher score = better rank' contract and are scored on NDCG@k / MAP / P@5 / MRR over a synthetic LETOR-style graded-relevance dataset.",
